Package: wingman
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         libcap2-bin,
         netbird,
         polkitd
Description: manage isolated NetBird instances
 Wingman runs multiple NetBird instances with separate state, daemon sockets,
 and WireGuard interfaces. It also provides concise status and peer views.
 .
 This package grants the NetBird binary the narrowly required capabilities for
 rootless instances, configures systemd-resolved access via polkit, and restores
 those capabilities whenever dpkg replaces /usr/bin/netbird.
